{
    "title": "WooPlus: Curvy Dating App",
    "description": "<h2>\ud83d\udd25 Featured on BBC, Forbes, Google Play & the App Store! </h2>\r\n\r\n<h2>Meet BBW on WooPlus:</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking to chat and date plus-size singles?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WooPlus is the dating app where you can connect with plus-size singles and people who appreciate curvy bodies\u2014something you won't find on most other dating apps. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>WooPlus stands out as the leading <b>BBW dating app</b>, acting as cupid for those who respect and like plus-size women. Here, you can embrace your curves without fear of body shaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With over <b>12 million users</b>, join a vibrant community where you can effortlessly chat, date, meet new people, and start your dating journey!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Our Features:</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>\u2728 Free to Join  </h3>\r\n<p>The ultimate dating app for big beautiful women (BBW) & big and tall singles\u2014completely free to start!  </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Easy Chat Features  </h3>\r\n<p>Send a simple \"Hi\" and start to chat immediately\u2014meet new people is that easy!  </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>\ud83c\udfa5 Show Off Your Personality  </h3>\r\n<p>Flaunt your charm through video features and boost your chances of finding that perfect match. </p> \r\n\r\n<h3>\u2714\ufe0f Authentic Profiles Only  </h3>\r\n<p>Every profile is verified by professionals to <b>eliminate bots and scammers</b>, so you can feel safe in your dating journey. </p> \r\n\r\n<h3>\ud83c\udf0d Inclusive Community  </h3>\r\n<p>Meet and chat with local plus-size singles in your area, make new friends, and date those who appreciate curvy beauty.  </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udc68 Female-Friendly Environment  </h3>\r\n<p>Feel confident in a supportive space where full-figured beauty is celebrated. </p> \r\n\r\n<h3>\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Curvy Ally Badge  </h3>\r\n<p>Special recognition for men who genuinely love and respect curvy women.</p>  \r\n\r\n<h3>\ud83d\udeab No Ads!  </h3>\r\n<p>Enjoy a completely ad-free dating experience while you focus on meeting real people to chat.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>WooPlus in the headline:</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\ud83c\udf1f \"WooPlus is a safe and comfortable space to let love in.\" - BBC </p>\r\n<p>\ud83c\udf1f \"WooPlus wants to end the 'marginalization of people with atypical bodies'.\" - PEOPLE</p> \r\n<p>\ud83c\udf1f \"Plus-size dating app WooPlus will now ban 'fat-shaming fools'.\"- YAHOO</p> \r\n<p>\ud83c\udf1f \"WooPlus, hailed as an answer to Tinder for the bigger and rounder female population.\" - MIRROR</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WooPlus is open to adults from around the world, including the US, UK, Canada, Australia, Germany and more. Whether you're interested in dating curvy girls, super-size big beautiful women (SSBBW), or chubby guys, we welcome you. Moreover, WooPlus is an inclusive dating app, celebrating diversity whether you're Black, Latino, Asian, interracial, or part of the LGBTQ+ community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On WooPlus, connections go beyond the surface. We embrace body diversity and ensure everyone feels valued and respected. Join us and be part of a truly inclusive dating experience!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\ud83d\udcf2 Follow us @wooplus_dating on <b>Instagram</b> and <b>TikTok</b> to stay connected!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Terms of Service: https://www.wooplus.com/terms/</p>\r\n<p>- Privacy Policy: https://www.wooplus.com/privacy/</p>\r\n<p>- Dating Tips: https://www.wooplus.com/bbwdating/</p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h2>\ud83d\udd25 Featured on BBC, Forbes, Google Play &amp; the App Store! </h2><br><br><h2>Meet BBW on WooPlus:</h2><br><br><p>Looking to chat and date plus-size singles?</p><br><br><p>WooPlus is the dating app where you can connect with plus-size singles and people who appreciate curvy bodies\u2014something you won&#39;t find on most other dating apps. </p><br><br><p>WooPlus stands out as the leading <b>BBW dating app</b>, acting as cupid for those who respect and like plus-size women. Here, you can embrace your curves without fear of body shaming.</p><br><br><p>With over <b>12 million users</b>, join a vibrant community where you can effortlessly chat, date, meet new people, and start your dating journey!</p><br><br><h2>Our Features:</h2><br><br><h3>\u2728 Free to Join  </h3><br><p>The ultimate dating app for big beautiful women (BBW) &amp; big and tall singles\u2014completely free to start!  </p><br><br><h3>\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Easy Chat Features  </h3><br><p>Send a simple &quot;Hi&quot; and start to chat immediately\u2014meet new people is that easy!  </p><br><br><h3>\ud83c\udfa5 Show Off Your Personality  </h3><br><p>Flaunt your charm through video features and boost your chances of finding that perfect match. </p> <br><br><h3>\u2714\ufe0f Authentic Profiles Only  </h3><br><p>Every profile is verified by professionals to <b>eliminate bots and scammers</b>, so you can feel safe in your dating journey. </p> <br><br><h3>\ud83c\udf0d Inclusive Community  </h3><br><p>Meet and chat with local plus-size singles in your area, make new friends, and date those who appreciate curvy beauty.  </p><br><br><h3>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udc68 Female-Friendly Environment  </h3><br><p>Feel confident in a supportive space where full-figured beauty is celebrated. </p> <br><br><h3>\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Curvy Ally Badge  </h3><br><p>Special recognition for men who genuinely love and respect curvy women.</p>  <br><br><h3>\ud83d\udeab No Ads!  </h3><br><p>Enjoy a completely ad-free dating experience while you focus on meeting real people to chat.</p><br><br><h2>WooPlus in the headline:</h2><br><br><p>\ud83c\udf1f &quot;WooPlus is a safe and comfortable space to let love in.&quot; - BBC </p><br><p>\ud83c\udf1f &quot;WooPlus wants to end the &#39;marginalization of people with atypical bodies&#39;.&quot; - PEOPLE</p> <br><p>\ud83c\udf1f &quot;Plus-size dating app WooPlus will now ban &#39;fat-shaming fools&#39;.&quot;- YAHOO</p> <br><p>\ud83c\udf1f &quot;WooPlus, hailed as an answer to Tinder for the bigger and rounder female population.&quot; - MIRROR</p><br><br><p>WooPlus is open to adults from around the world, including the US, UK, Canada, Australia, Germany and more. Whether you&#39;re interested in dating curvy girls, super-size big beautiful women (SSBBW), or chubby guys, we welcome you. Moreover, WooPlus is an inclusive dating app, celebrating diversity whether you&#39;re Black, Latino, Asian, interracial, or part of the LGBTQ+ community.</p><br><br><p>On WooPlus, connections go beyond the surface. We embrace body diversity and ensure everyone feels valued and respected. Join us and be part of a truly inclusive dating experience!</p><br><br><p>\ud83d\udcf2 Follow us @wooplus_dating on <b>Instagram</b> and <b>TikTok</b> to stay connected!</p><br><br><p>- Terms of Service: https://www.wooplus.com/terms/</p><br><p>- Privacy Policy: https://www.wooplus.com/privacy/</p><br><p>- Dating Tips: https://www.wooplus.com/bbwdating/</p>",
